    "detailed_description": "<h1>Update Notes</h1><p>Behold the Brick Separator!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791820/extras/d64c4c3e31ae925212f0a7a4c9a1cdaf.avif?t=1746039091\" width=774 height=918 /></span><br><br>With this marvelous tools you'll be able to separate any bricks.</p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Experience the boundless world of virtual brick-building in Master Builder Simulator! </strong></h2><br>Whether you're a seasoned enthusiast or a novice, our game offers endless possibilities:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Dive into Single Player Sandbox mode and create to your heart's content using a wide array of bricks. <br></li><li> Challenge yourself in Model Building mode by following step-by-step guides to craft intricate structures.<br></li><li> Team up with friends in Multiplayer Co-op mode to embark on collaborative building adventures, unleashing your collective creativity. <br></li><li> Or, if you're feeling competitive, engage in Multiplayer versus mode, where you and your friends race to build the same set, testing your speed and precision.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unpack your set</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791820/extras/6ae92b7dd8f9514d00aec4338efe4aac.poster.avif?t=1746039091\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791820/extras/6ae92b7dd8f9514d00aec4338efe4aac.webm?t=1746039091\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791820/extras/6ae92b7dd8f9514d00aec4338efe4aac.mp4?t=1746039091\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build your model</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791820/extras/d173bc70bc450c9a838ccf24e5e27151.poster.avif?t=1746039091\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791820/extras/d173bc70bc450c9a838ccf24e5e27151.webm?t=1746039091\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791820/extras/d173bc70bc450c9a838ccf24e5e27151.mp4?t=1746039091\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Have fun!</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791820/extras/e5481844a176a6b0515b8820404dcb55.poster.avif?t=1746039091\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791820/extras/e5481844a176a6b0515b8820404dcb55.webm?t=1746039091\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791820/extras/e5481844a176a6b0515b8820404dcb55.mp4?t=1746039091\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Modes</h2>With a diverse range of modes, Master Builder Simulator lets you explore your architectural imagination like never before. Embrace the freedom to design, construct, and innovate, all within the virtual realm of bricks. Whether you're seeking a solo creative outlet or the thrill of multiplayer brick-building challenges, our game has something for everyone. Unleash your inner architect, embark on brick-building adventures, and craft stunning masterpieces in this immersive experience!",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Experience the boundless world of virtual brick-building in Master Builder Simulator! </strong></h2><br>Whether you're a seasoned enthusiast or a novice, our game offers endless possibilities:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Dive into Single Player Sandbox mode and create to your heart's content using a wide array of bricks. <br></li><li> Challenge yourself in Model Building mode by following step-by-step guides to craft intricate structures.<br></li><li> Team up with friends in Multiplayer Co-op mode to embark on collaborative building adventures, unleashing your collective creativity. <br></li><li> Or, if you're feeling competitive, engage in Multiplayer versus mode, where you and your friends race to build the same set, testing your speed and precision.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unpack your set</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791820/extras/6ae92b7dd8f9514d00aec4338efe4aac.poster.avif?t=1746039091\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791820/extras/6ae92b7dd8f9514d00aec4338efe4aac.webm?t=1746039091\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791820/extras/6ae92b7dd8f9514d00aec4338efe4aac.mp4?t=1746039091\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build your model</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791820/extras/d173bc70bc450c9a838ccf24e5e27151.poster.avif?t=1746039091\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791820/extras/d173bc70bc450c9a838ccf24e5e27151.webm?t=1746039091\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791820/extras/d173bc70bc450c9a838ccf24e5e27151.mp4?t=1746039091\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Have fun!</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791820/extras/e5481844a176a6b0515b8820404dcb55.poster.avif?t=1746039091\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791820/extras/e5481844a176a6b0515b8820404dcb55.webm?t=1746039091\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791820/extras/e5481844a176a6b0515b8820404dcb55.mp4?t=1746039091\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Modes</h2>With a diverse range of modes, Master Builder Simulator lets you explore your architectural imagination like never before. Embrace the freedom to design, construct, and innovate, all within the virtual realm of bricks. Whether you're seeking a solo creative outlet or the thrill of multiplayer brick-building challenges, our game has something for everyone. Unleash your inner architect, embark on brick-building adventures, and craft stunning masterpieces in this immersive experience!",
    "short_description": "Dive into virtual brick-building with Master Builder Simulator! Explore solo or with friends in Sandbox, Model Building, Co-op, or versus modes. Unleash your inner Master Builder in endless creative adventures!",
